<p>Hi,</p>
<p>please confirm your Capsule Zero email address.</p>
<p>Your confirmation code: <strong>{{ .VerificationCode }}</strong></p>
{{- $locale := "en" }}
{{- if .Identity }}{{ with index .Identity.traits "locale" }}{{ $locale = . }}{{ end }}{{ end }}
<p>Or <a href="{{ .VerificationURL | replace "/self-service/verification?" (printf "/%s/verify-email?" $locale) }}">open this link</a> to confirm instantly.</p>
<p>The code and link expire in 1 hour. If you did not create a Capsule Zero account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
